OL,3,GNEWSADelayed park awaits opening date
OL,4,Atwo months on
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo new opening date for a city centre
OL,7,Fpark has been confirmed two months
OL,8,Fafter it was supposed to welcome its
OL,9,Ffirst visitors.
OL,11,FRiverside Park in Sunderland was
OL,12,Fexpected to open on 21 July, but
OL,13,Finstead signs were put up at the site
OL,14,Ftelling people it was remaining off
OL,15,Flimits due to dry weather.
OL,17,FThe 47 acre-facility sits on both sides
OL,18,Fof the River Wear and will eventually
OL,19,Finclude walking routes, exercise zones,
OL,20,Fplay areas, community spaces and a
OL,21,Fskate park.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
