OL,3,GNEWSADelayed park awaits opening date
OL,4,Atwo months on
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunderland City Council said it had
OL,7,Fdecided to "defer" the opening so
OL,8,Fplanting and landscaping can become
OL,9,F"more established". A spokesperson
OL,10,Fsaid: "We will announce a revised
OL,11,Fopening date in due course."
